# FIX(Roast-63 · C1): כספת-המפתחות-המוצפנת — אף-פעם-לא-בגיט (היה-עוקב למרות *.db — נוסף-אחרי-המעקב)
agent/vault/

# R16: DB-גיבויים לעולם-לא-בגיט (היו-נעקבים דרך סיומת .bak) — מחלקת CRITICAL-R11-KEY-BROADCAST
*.bak
db/*.bak

# SAOS-LEGION runtime (EXEC-CD-22) — the chain journal of the engine is the canonical ledger
mini-services/saos-legion/state/*
!mini-services/saos-legion/state/.gitkeep
mini-services/saos-legion/legion-dev.log
mini-services/saos-legion/legion-spawn.log

# SOVEREIGN-GATEWAY runtime heartbeat — live state never in git (write only its .gitkeep)
mini-services/sovereign-gateway/state/*
