.autonomy-genesis-done

# T-34 sealed local state — recovery staging map + shards NEVER in git (capture-resistance)
state/recovery/
agent/seal-shards/
db/seal-shards/

# SANBOX — שרת-ה-HQ של-המפעיל (repo-גיט-עצמאי; T-46 · אסור-לקנן-בגיט-האם)
/sanbox/
dev.log.tail

# audit wave-0 (ops-control): live-state files must never be tracked
repo-vault/

